  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to deliver&#xA0;Trade Policy short term training scholarships to 30 scholars from Samoa, Tonga, Niue, Tuvalu, Kiribati, Fiji, French Pacific, Solomon Islands and Papua New Guinea.
